      "content": "<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 10th April Evening Shift Chemistry - Structure of Atom Question 77 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lgx3om8n/12f161df-b9a3-4ac1-880d-c04413a68649/59701a70-e3dd-11ed-baaf-253646c1f54e/file-1lgx3om8o.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>The electron in the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.325ex\" height=\"2.021ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -893.3 1911.8 893.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"